@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Set your local test password in the HTTP client's private environment.
@password = {{test_password}}

### Health checks the database
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health

### Fetch CSRF (HTTP client must retain cookies)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrf_token", response.body.csrf_token); %}

### Register customer (does not sign in)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"email":"customer@example.com","password":"{{password}}","name":"Khách hàng"}

### Login sets HttpOnly cookie; fetch CSRF again afterward
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"email":"customer@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### Current public user
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me

### Refresh CSRF after login
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrf_token", response.body.csrf_token); %}

### Logout clears auth and CSRF cookies
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

# --- Sales (P3): cart ---
# Login first; every write below needs the CSRF token from GET /api/v1/auth/csrf.

### Current cart with subtotal, shipping fee and total
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cart

### Add product (accumulates when the product is already in the cart)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"product_id": 1, "qty": 2}

### Change quantity of one cart line (1..99, cannot exceed stock)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"qty": 3}

### Remove one cart line
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/cart/items/1
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

### Preview a voucher discount (does not consume a voucher turn)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/cart/apply-voucher
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"code": "WELCOME10"}

# --- Sales (P3): orders ---

### Checkout: create order, decrement stock/voucher, clear cart (201)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"name":"Khách hàng","phone":"0901234567","address":"269/20 Lý Thường Kiệt, TP.HCM","payment_method":"COD","voucher_code":"WELCOME10"}

### Current user's order history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&page_size=10

### Public tracking by order code + phone (owner/admin may skip phone when signed in)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/EH-XXXX?phone=0901234567

### Pay: COD confirms and stays pending; CHUYEN_KHOAN_MOCK marks paid
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders/EH-XXXX/pay
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"method": "COD"}

### Admin: list orders (sign in as an admin first)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/orders?status=pending&page=1&page_size=20

### Admin: change status pending -> confirmed -> shipping -> done|cancelled
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/admin/orders/EH-XXXX
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}}

{"status": "confirmed"}
